<%- include('header') %>
<section class="welcome-banner"><div><span class="eyebrow">CARE STARTS HERE</span><h1>给每一个小生命，<br>一个新的开始。</h1><p>从发现、救助到找到新家，在这里记录每一步。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/animals/new">＋ 登记新动物</a><a class="text-link" href="/animals">查看全部档案 ↗</a></div></div><div class="journey-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-orbit"></span><div class="art-animal">🐈</div><span class="art-tag tag-one">♡ 用心救助</span><span class="art-tag tag-two">⌂ 温暖归宿</span></div></section>
<div class="section-heading dashboard-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">OVERVIEW</span><h2>救助概览</h2></div><span class="muted">全部动物档案</span></div>
<div class="metrics"><section class="metric"><span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span><span>动物档案总数</span><strong class="number"><%= total %><small>只</small></strong><p>每份档案，记录一个生命</p></section><% rescueCounts.forEach((item,i) => { %><section class="metric metric-<%= i %>"><span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true"><%= ['◷','♡','⌂'][i] %></span><span><%= item.label %></span><strong class="number"><%= item.count %><small>只</small></strong><p><%= ['等待救助人员跟进','持续关注治疗与恢复','已安排安置地点'][i] %></p></section><% }) %></div>
<div class="columns"><section class="panel"><div class="section-heading"><h2>最近更新</h2><a href="/animals">全部档案 ↗</a></div><% animals.forEach(animal => { %><div class="record-row"><span class="animal-avatar" aria-hidden="true"><%= animal.animalType === 'cat' ? '🐈' : '🐕' %></span><div class="record-copy"><strong><%= animal.animalCode %></strong><p><%= animal.appearance %></p><small><%= animal.foundLocation %> · <%= formatDate(animal.updatedAt) %></small></div><span class="badge status-<%= animal.rescueStatus %>"><%= labels.rescueStatuses[animal.rescueStatus] %></span><a class="arrow-link" href="/animals/<%= animal._id %>" aria-label="查看 <%= animal.animalCode %> 详情">↗</a></div><% }) %></section><section class="panel"><span class="eyebrow">A NEW HOME</span><h2>领养进展</h2><% adoptionCounts.forEach((item,i) => { %><div class="adoption-row"><div><span><i class="legend-dot legend-<%= i %>"></i><%= item.label %></span><strong><%= item.count %></strong></div><div class="progress-track"><span class="progress-fill fill-<%= i %>" style="width:<%= total ? item.count / total * 100 : 0 %>%"></span></div></div><% }) %><p class="panel-note">已领养动物继续保留完整档案。</p></section></div>
<%- include('footer') %>
